        "Before the next review, write down what How should a BDR team document buyer objections across segments in the next audit cycle is meant to prevent and how the team would notice a gap. It distinguishes a temporary condition from a structural mismatch. It also shows which objections recur in which segments. If the same question appears twice, fix the template rather than the answer."
